{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Untwisting the twisted gl(4) L=2 norm through a 2x2 minor\n\n**Idea (Paul, 2026-09-11).** The twisted orthogonality system is linear in eight differences of integrals of motion. At zero twist only two stay independent, `Δtc_1` and `Δc'` (`SU4_SoV_Orthogonality_Untwisted_L2.wb`). So change basis in the column space so that two coordinates are `(Δtc_1, Δc')` and the other six are the combinations that vanish at zero twist. Also choose the Q-functions in the rows to be exact twisted solutions tending to the good untwisted pairings. Then the untwisted scalar product is a 2x2 minor of the transformed 8x8 matrix, and it should give the leading behaviour of the twisted norm as the twist is switched off.\n\n**Columns.** The unaligned identity `0 = ∮ μ R^j_A (O^A - O^B) R_i^{B[2]}` reads, with `E_2 = μ/(ν_1 ν_1^{[-2]})`,\n\n$$0 = \\sum_{\\text{poles}} E_2\\, R^j_A \\Big[-\\Delta T_1\\,\\nu_1^{[-2]} R^B_i + \\Delta T_2\\, R^{B[-2]}_i - \\nu_4(\\Delta\\tau_{3q}\\,u + \\Delta tc_5)\\, R^{B[-4]}_i\\Big],$$\n\nwhere `ΔT_1 = Δs_1 u + Δtc_1` and `ΔT_2 = Δs_2 u^3 + Δtc_2 u^2 + Δtc_3 u + Δtc_4` (the `s_a` are the weight-dependent subleading coefficients). New coordinates:\n\n`w = (Δtc_1, Δc', Δtc_2 - 2Δtc_1, Δtc_3 - κ_3Δtc_1, Δtc_5 - Δtc_1, Δs_1, Δs_2, Δτ_{3q})`, with `Δc' = Δtc_4 - k_0Δtc_1`, `κ_3 = -(2(θ_1+θ_2)+(S+P+2)h)`, `k_0 = ν_1(-h)+ν_4(0)`, so that `2u^2 + κ_3 u + k_0 = ν_1^{[-2]} + ν_4`. The last six vanish at zero twist. The change is triangular with unit diagonal. Columns 1-2 are exactly the untwisted difference form, `E_2 R^j(-ν_1^{[-2]}∇R_i + ν_4∇R_i^{[-2]})` and `E_2 R^j R_i^{[-2]}`.\n\n**Rows.** For each twisted state, `R_k = Σ_l c_l Q_l` and `R^k = Σ_l d_l Q^l` are fixed by matching the untwisted `q_k`, `q^k` at `u = 0,1,2,3`. These are exact twisted solutions tending to the untwisted ones. Rows are `(ladder s, pairing (i,j))` for the pairings `(2,1), (3,1), (4,1), (3,2)`; the first two rows, with columns 1-2, are the untwisted 2x2 `N'`.\n\n**Twist** `z = (1+ε, 1+ε/3, 1-ε/2, 1/∏)`: rational and unimodular. The twisted solve is exact; residues are evaluated at high precision. `θ_1 = 1/3, θ_2 = 1/7, h = 1`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Twisted setup: verbatim from ../Clean/SU4_SoV_ScalarProduct_L2.wb (cells 2, 3, 5), plus the cleared dual operator. ---- *)\nClearAll[z, χ, zvars, ν, ν1, qdet, Ξ, subl, τ, τ3quad, tc, tcvars, Mdeg, qc, qmonic, BaxRes, qpoly, TwistedSolve, BaxResD, prm, sub0, zeps];\nzvars = Table[z[j], {j, 4}];\nχ[a_] := χ[a] = Total[(Times @@ #) & /@ Subsets[zvars, {a}]];\nν[S_, P_][i_][u_] := (u - θ1 - h {S, S, 0, 0}[[i]]) (u - θ2 - h {P, P, 0, 0}[[i]]);\nν1[S_, P_][u_] := ν[S, P][1][u];\nqdet[S_, P_][u_] := χ[4] Product[ν[S, P][i][u - (4 - i) h], {i, 4}];\nΞ[a_, n_List] := Total[((Times @@ (z /@ #)) Total[n[[#]]]) & /@ Subsets[Range[4], {a}]];\nsubl[a_, n_List] := -a (θ1 + θ2 + (a - 1) h) χ[a] - h Ξ[a, n];\ntcvars = Table[tc[i], {i, 5}];\nτ[1][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := χ[1] u^2 + subl[1, μ] u + tc[1];\nτ[2][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := χ[2] u^4 + subl[2, μ] u^3 + tc[2] u^2 + tc[3] u + tc[4];\nτ3quad[S_, P_, μ_] := τ3quad[S, P, μ] = Module[{x, bb, expr}, expr = Expand[ν[S, P][1][x - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][x] (χ[3] x^2 + bb x + tc[5])]; Simplify[bb /. First@Solve[Coefficient[expr, x, 5] == subl[3, μ], bb]]];\nτ[3][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := ν[S, P][1][u - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][u] (χ[3] u^2 + τ3quad[S, P, μ] u + tc[5]);\nτ[4][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := qdet[S, P][u];\nMdeg[S_, P_, μ_List] := (S + P) - μ;\nqmonic[k_, M_][x_] := x^M + Sum[qc[k, j] x^j, {j, 0, M - 1}];\nqpoly[clist_List, uu_] := Module[{x}, (clist . x^Range[0, Length[clist] - 1]) /. x -> uu];\nBaxRes[S_, P_, μ_][k_][qf_][x_] := z[k]^4 Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 0, 3}] qf[x + h] - z[k]^3 τ[1][S, P, μ][x] Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 1, 3}] qf[x] + z[k]^2 τ[2][S, P, μ][x] Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 2, 3}] qf[x - h] - z[k] τ[3][S, P, μ][x] ν1[S, P][x - 3 h] qf[x - 2 h] + τ[4][S, P, μ][x] qf[x - 3 h];\nTwistedSolve[S_, P_, μ_List, sub_: {}] := Module[{Ms, x, eqs = {}, unk, sols, R},\n   Ms = Mdeg[S, P, μ];\n   Do[R = Expand[(BaxRes[S, P, μ][k][qmonic[k, Ms[[k]]]][x]) /. sub]; eqs = Join[eqs, DeleteCases[CoefficientList[R, x], 0]], {k, 4}];\n   unk = Join[tcvars, Flatten[Table[qc[k, j], {k, 4}, {j, 0, Ms[[k]] - 1}]]];\n   sols = Solve[Thread[eqs == 0], unk];\n   Table[<|\"M\" -> Ms, \"tc\" -> (tcvars /. s), \"q\" -> Table[PadRight[CoefficientList[qmonic[k, Ms[[k]]][x] /. s, x], Ms[[k]] + 1], {k, 4}]|>, {s, sols}]];\n(* Hodge duals (verbatim) *)\nClearAll[Wronsk, Vand, qWronsk, AA, qDual];\nWronsk[rec_, II_List][x_] := Module[{k = Length[II]}, Det[Table[z[II[[a]]]^(k - b) qpoly[rec[\"q\"][[II[[a]]]], x - (b - 1) h], {a, k}, {b, k}]]];\nVand[II_List] := Product[z[II[[a]]] - z[II[[b]]], {a, Length[II]}, {b, a + 1, Length[II]}];\nqWronsk[rec_, II_List][x_] := Cancel[Together[Wronsk[rec, II][x]/Vand[II]]];\nAA[SS_, PP_][x_] := Product[x - θ1 - j h, {j, SS}] Product[x - θ2 - j h, {j, PP}];\nqDual[SS_, PP_, r_, sub_][j_][v_] := Cancel[Together[(qWronsk[r, Complement[{1, 2, 3, 4}, {j}]][v + (h /. sub)]/AA[SS, PP][v + (h /. sub)]) /. sub]];\n(* dual operator O-dagger times its denominators (acts on the uncentred dual) *)\nBaxResD[S_, P_, μ_][G_][x_] := Product[ν[S, P][4][x + m h], {m, 1, 4}] G[x] - τ[1][S, P, μ][x + h] Product[ν[S, P][4][x + m h], {m, 2, 4}] G[x + h] + τ[2][S, P, μ][x + 2 h] Product[ν[S, P][4][x + m h], {m, 3, 4}] G[x + 2 h] - τ[3][S, P, μ][x + 3 h] ν[S, P][4][x + 4 h] G[x + 3 h] + τ[4][S, P, μ][x + 4 h] G[x + 4 h];\nprm = {θ1 -> 1/3, θ2 -> 1/7, h -> 1};\nsub0 = Join[prm, Table[z[j] -> 1, {j, 4}]];\nzeps[ε_] := Join[prm, {z[1] -> 1 + ε, z[2] -> 1 + ε/3, z[3] -> 1 - ε/2, z[4] -> 1/((1 + ε) (1 + ε/3) (1 - ε/2))}];\n{\"1. loaded; zeps unimodular?\", Simplify[Product[z[j], {j, 4}] /. zeps[ε]] === 1}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"30\" data-sub-idx=\"32\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"37\" data-sub-end=\"37\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[30]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsZWZ0XHtcdGV4dHsxLiBsb2FkZWQ7IHplcHMgdW5pbW9kdWxhcj99IFxyaWdodC4gXFwKICAmXGxlZnQuICxcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9XHJpZ2h0XH0KXGVuZHthbGlnbmVkfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1. loaded; zeps unimodular?</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[30]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{1. loaded; zeps unimodular?} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
