an><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.165em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.83em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.165em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.665em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.665em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.92em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.665em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.665em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.33em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.665em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.165em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[33]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{mu} & \\text{tc (z=1)} & \\text{deg q\\_k} & \\text{deg q\\^{}4..q\\^{}1}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\frac{22}{7},\\frac{7214}{147},-\\frac{4472}{147},\\frac{3812}{441},\\frac{274}{21}\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,4,5\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,4,5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\frac{8}{7},\\frac{6626}{147},-\\frac{3016}{147},-\\frac{640}{441},\\frac{232}{21}\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,3,5\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,3,5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-\\frac{20}{7},\\frac{5450}{147},-\\frac{104}{147},\\frac{1040}{441},\\frac{148}{21}\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,3,4\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,3,4\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
