  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. The limit eps -> 0\n\nThe column integrands do not involve `tc`, and `R -> q` as the twist is switched off. So `M'^{AA}(ε)` tends to the same 8x8 built from the **untwisted** Q-functions, which can be computed exactly. The questions are:\n\n- Is `det M'(0) ≠ 0`?\n- Does the Laplace expansion over the two surviving columns reduce to the single term (rows of pairing `(2,1)`) = `N'_{untw}` × (complementary 6x6)?\n- Does the twisted `det M'(ε)` approach it, and do the six vanishing coordinates `w_3..w_8` of a cross pair shrink like `ε`?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. Exact zero-twist 8x8 from the UNTWISTED Q-functions only (no twisted solve), and its Laplace expansion\n   over the two surviving columns {1,2}. Memory capped at 2 GB: a blow-up aborts this cell, not the machine. ---- *)\nClearAll[laplace, zeroTab];\n(* Laplace terms over column pair {1,2}: rows R, sign (-1)^(R1+R2+1+2) *)\nlaplace[M_] := Table[{R, (-1)^(Total[R] + 3) Det[M[[R, {1, 2}]]] Det[M[[Complement[Range[8], R], 3 ;; 8]]]}, {R, Subsets[Range[8], {2}]}];\nzeroTab = MemoryConstrained[Table[With[{M0 = Together[Mp[1, 1, untQ[1, 1, \\[Mu]], untQ[1, 1, \\[Mu]], rowsDef]]}, With[{lp = laplace[M0]},\n      <|\"mu\" -> \\[Mu], \"det M'(0)\" -> Together[Det[M0]], \"N' (rows (2,1))\" -> Together[Det[M0[[{1, 2}, {1, 2}]]]], \"6x6 complement\" -> Together[Det[M0[[3 ;; 8, 3 ;; 8]]]],\n        \"(2,1) Laplace term\" -> Together[lp[[1, 2]]], \"sum of Laplace terms - det\" -> Together[Total[lp[[All, 2]]] - Det[M0]],\n        \"nonzero Laplace terms\" -> Select[{#[[1]], Together[#[[2]]]} & /@ lp, #[[2]] =!= 0 &]|>]], {\\[Mu], {{2, 2, 0, 0}, {2, 1, 1, 0}, {1, 1, 1, 1}}}], 2*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\nIf[StringQ[zeroTab], zeroTab, Grid[Prepend[Values /@ zeroTab, Keys[First[zeroTab]]], Frame -> All]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"4\" data-out-n=\"51\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"9\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[51]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"12\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:24.1371em;vertical-align:-11.7985em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.3385em;\"><span style=\"top:-14.2985em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.2985em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:24.0971em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-11.7985em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.2985em;\"><span style=\"top:-19.1315em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.673em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mu</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-17.9264em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.673em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.8934em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.673em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.0474em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.673em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:11.7985em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:24.0971em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-11.7985em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" styl