  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. Structure of the degeneracy of M'(0): ranks of the full matrix, of the two surviving columns, of the six\n   vanishing columns, and the kernel in w-coordinates (w1, w2 | w3..w8). If the kernel lies in the w3..w8 block, the\n   leading eps-term of det M' involves only the eps-derivatives of the vanishing columns. Exact; memory capped. ---- *)\nClearAll[kerTab];\nkerTab = MemoryConstrained[Table[With[{M0 = Together[Mp[1, 1, untQ[1, 1, μ], untQ[1, 1, μ], rowsDef]]}, With[{ker = NullSpace[M0]},\n      {μ, MatrixRank[M0], MatrixRank[M0[[All, 1 ;; 2]]], MatrixRank[M0[[All, 3 ;; 8]]], Length[ker], AllTrue[ker, #[[1 ;; 2]] === {0, 0} &], ker}]], {μ, {{2, 2, 0, 0}, {2, 1, 1, 0}, {1, 1, 1, 1}}}], 2*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\nIf[StringQ[kerTab], kerTab, Grid[Prepend[kerTab, {\"mu\", \"rank M'(0)\", \"rank cols 1-2\", \"rank cols 3-8\", \"dim ker\", \"ker inside w3..w8\", \"kernel (w-coords)\"}], Frame -> All]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
