  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Where the kernel of M'(0) comes from: the degenerate partners\n\n**Hypothesis.** Twisted states A' that tend to descendants of A's irrep have the same zero-twist transfer matrix, hence the same limiting Q-space. Their whole `w(A,A')` vanishes like `ε`, and `M'^{AA'}(ε) → M'^{AA}(0)`. The cross identity `M'^{AA'} w(A,A') = 0`, divided by `ε`, then gives\n\n$$M'^{AA}(0)\\cdot \\lim_{\\varepsilon\\to0}\\frac{w(A,A')}{\\varepsilon} = 0 .$$\n\n**Test.** For every weight of the tensor product other than A's, solve the twisted system **numerically** for `tc` only (no Q-functions are needed for `w`). Keep the states whose `tc` lies within `300ε` of A's zero-twist `tc`. Then check that `w/ε` is annihilated by `M'^{AA}(0)` up to `O(ε)`, and that the partners span the kernel.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. Degenerate partners of A and the kernel of M'(0). Numeric solves at WorkingPrecision prec; memory/time capped.\n   NB: never use \\[Nu] as a loop or pattern variable here -- \\[Nu][S,P][i][u] is the global Yangian-weight function, and Do/Table\n   temporarily reassign their iterator, which silently corrupts \\[Nu] and poisons the memoised \\[Tau]3quad. ---- *)\nClearAll[twTcN, partnerTest, irrepsList];\n(* drop any poisoned cache entries of \\[Tau]3quad, keeping only its defining rule *)\nDownValues[\\[Tau]3quad] = Select[DownValues[\\[Tau]3quad], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &];\nirrepsList[S_, P_] := Flatten[Table[{S + P - j, S + P - k, k, j}, {j, 0, Min[S, P]}, {k, j, Min[S, P]}], 1];\n(* all twisted tc of weight nu at twist eps (numeric) *)\ntwTcN[S_, P_, nu_, eps_, prec_] := Module[{Ms = Mdeg[S, P, nu], x, eqs = {}, unk},\n   If[Min[Ms] < 0, Return[{}]];\n   Do[eqs = Join[eqs, DeleteCases[CoefficientList[Expand[BaxRes[S, P, nu][k][qmonic[k, Ms[[k]]]][x] /. zeps[eps]], x], 0]], {k, 4}];\n   unk = Join[tcvars, Flatten[Table[qc[k, j], {k, 4}, {j, 0, Ms[[k]] - 1}]]];\n   tcvars /. NSolve[Thread[eqs == 0], unk, WorkingPrecision -> prec]];\npartnerTest[S_, P_, mu_, eps_, prec_] := Module[{t0 = N[UntwSolve0[S, P, mu][\"tc\"] /. prm, prec], wts, tcA, A, parts = {}, M0, ker, W, res},\n   wts = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Permutations /@ irrepsList[S, P], 1]], mu];\n   tcA = First[SortBy[twTcN[S, P, mu, eps, prec], Norm[# - t0] &]];\n   A = <|\"mu\" -> mu, \"tc\" -> tcA, \"sub\" -> zeps[eps]|>;\n   Do[Do[If[Norm[t - t0] < 300 eps, AppendTo[parts, {wt, t}]], {t, twTcN[S, P, wt, eps, prec]}], {wt, wts}];\n   M0 = Together[Mp[S, P, untQ[S, P, mu], untQ[S, P, mu], rowsDef]]; ker = NullSpace[M0];\n   W = Table[wvec[S, P, A, <|\"mu\" -> p[[1]], \"tc\" -> p[[2]], \"sub\" -> zeps[eps]|>]/eps, {p, parts}];\n   res = Table[Norm[N[M0, prec] . w]/Norm[w], {w, W}];\n   <|\"mu\" -> mu, \"eps\" -> eps, \"#partners\" -> Length[parts], \"partner weights\" -> parts[[All, 1]],\n     \"max |M'(0).w/eps| / |w/eps|\" -> If[W === {}, \"none\", N[Max[res], 5]], \"dim ker M'(0)\" -> Length[ker],\n     \"singular values of the partner w/eps (normalised)\" -> If[W === {}, \"none\", N[SingularValueList[Normalize /@ W, Tolerance -> 0], 5]],\n     \"rank of [ker ; partners] at 1e-6\" -> MatrixRank[Join[N[Normalize /@ ker, prec], Normalize /@ W], Tolerance -> 10^-6]|>];\npartnerTab = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[Table[partnerTest[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, e, 60], {e, {1/1000, 1/10000}}], 600, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 3*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\nIf[StringQ[partnerTab], partnerTab, Grid[Prepend[Values /@ partnerTab, Keys[First[partnerTab]]], Frame -> All]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
