  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Diagnostic: the ansatz at non-dominant weights\n\nThe first partner search found nothing, and a subsequent exact solve at the non-dominant weight `{1,2,1,0}` returned no solutions. **The cause was a scoping bug, not the ansatz.** The partner loop used `ν` as its iterator. `Do` temporarily reassigns its iterator globally, which overwrote the Yangian-weight function `ν[S,P][i][u]` during the loop. That poisoned the memoised `τ3quad` at every weight visited, and later solves reused the bad cache. Cell 11 now uses `nu`/`wt` and clears the cache first.\n\nThe check below confirms the ansatz itself is fine. With the three subleading coefficients left **free**, the solve at `{1,2,1,0}` gives the expected 2 states, and their subleading coefficients agree with the formula `[u^{2a-1}]τ_a = -a(θ_1+θ_2+(a-1)h)χ_a - h D_νχ_a` evaluated at `ν` itself.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 9. Free-subleading twisted solve at a weight nu; which permutation of nu does the subleading formula need? ---- *)\nClearAll[freeSubl];\nfreeSubl[S_, P_, nu_, ε_] := Module[{sub = zeps[ε], Ms = Mdeg[S, P, nu], x, t1, t2, t3, t4, res, eqs = {}, unk, sols, pred, vals, sl},\n   t1[y_] := χ[1] y^2 + sl[1] y + tc[1];\n   t2[y_] := χ[2] y^4 + sl[2] y^3 + tc[2] y^2 + tc[3] y + tc[4];\n   t3[y_] := ν1[S, P][y - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][y] (χ[3] y^2 + sl[3] y + tc[5]);\n   t4[y_] := qdet[S, P][y];\n   res[k_, qf_] := z[k]^4 Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 0, 3}] qf[x + h] - z[k]^3 t1[x] Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 1, 3}] qf[x] + z[k]^2 t2[x] Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 2, 3}] qf[x - h] - z[k] t3[x] ν1[S, P][x - 3 h] qf[x - 2 h] + t4[x] qf[x - 3 h];\n   Do[eqs = Join[eqs, DeleteCases[CoefficientList[Expand[res[k, qmonic[k, Ms[[k]]]] /. sub], x], 0]], {k, 4}];\n   unk = Join[tcvars, {sl[1], sl[2], sl[3]}, Flatten[Table[qc[k, j], {k, 4}, {j, 0, Ms[[k]] - 1}]]];\n   sols = Solve[Thread[eqs == 0], unk];\n   vals = Union[Round[N[{sl[1], sl[2], sl[3]} /. #, 30], 10^-20] & /@ sols];\n   pred[n_] := Round[N[{subl[1, n], subl[2, n], τ[3][S, P, n][x] // Coefficient[PolynomialQuotient[Expand[# /. tc[5] -> 0], Expand[ν1[S, P][x - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][x]], x], x, 1] &} /. sub, 30], 10^-20];\n   {nu, Length[sols], N[vals, 7], N[pred[nu], 7], Select[Permutations[nu], MemberQ[vals, pred[#]] &]}];\ndiagTab = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[{freeSubl[1, 1, {1, 2, 1, 0}, 1/1000], freeSubl[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, 1/1000]}, 400, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 2*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\nIf[StringQ[diagTab], diagTab, Grid[Prepend[diagTab, {\"nu\", \"#solutions (free subleading)\", \"actual subleading (s1, s2, s3)\", \"formula at nu\", \"permutations of nu reproducing it\"}], Frame -> All]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"9\" data-out-n=\"75\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[75]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"12\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.66em;vertical-align:-1.56em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.06em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.62em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.56em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.06em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.22em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nu</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><spa