   "value": "**Step 1 result (cell 17).** In every full-contour row the powers follow a fixed offset profile across the columns: `(0, 0, -2, -1, -2, -3, -3, -3)` relative to column 1. The row-dependent base power ranges from 1 for `(4,1)` to 4 for the `i < j` pairings; negative powers mean the raw `q_k` diverge. Diagonal pairings `(i,i)` vanish identically in columns 1-5 and are O(1) in the weight columns 6-8. The good rows are O(1) everywhere. So columns 1-2 are the **most** suppressed in every full row. The smallest total power is reached by the block assignment (six full rows ↔ columns 3-8, good rows ↔ columns 1-2), and any other assignment costs at least one more power of `ε`. The caveat is that columns 6-8 share the same power in each row, so the leading 6x6 coefficients may cancel.\n\n**Step 2: the direct test.** Does the block Laplace term dominate the full determinant?\n\n$$\\frac{\\det M'(\\varepsilon)}{\\det[\\text{6 full rows} \\times \\text{cols } 3..8]\\ \\det[\\text{2 good rows} \\times \\text{cols } 1,2]} \\to 1 ,\\qquad \\det[\\text{good} \\times \\text{cols }1,2] \\to N' .$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 12. Block-dominance test for several choices of the six full-contour rows. Rows 1-2 = good rows (regularised (2,1), ladders 1,2). ---- *)\nClearAll[blockTest];\nblockTest[S_, P_, mu_, fullSet_, eps_, prec_] := Module[{Q = mkQ[S, P, mu, eps, prec], M, D, m2, m6},\n   M = Join[Table[goodRow[S, P, Q, Q, s, {2, 1}], {s, 2}], Table[fullRow[S, P, Q, Q, ij], {ij, fullSet}]];\n   D = Det[M]; m2 = Det[M[[1 ;; 2, 1 ;; 2]]]; m6 = Det[M[[3 ;; 8, 3 ;; 8]]];\n   {eps, N[D, 8], N[m2, 12], N[D/(m2 m6), 10]}];\nblockSets = {{{2, 1}, {3, 1}, {4, 1}, {3, 2}, {4, 2}, {4, 3}}, {{1, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 3}, {4, 1}, {3, 1}, {4, 2}}, {{1, 1}, {2, 2}, {4, 4}, {4, 1}, {3, 2}, {4, 3}}};\nblockRes = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[Table[Prepend[#, fs] & /@ Table[blockTest[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, fs, e, 80], {e, {1/1000, 1/10000}}], {fs, blockSets}], 700, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 3*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\nIf[StringQ[blockRes], blockRes, Column[{Row[{\"untwisted N' for {2,1,1,0}: \", N[Det[Mp[1, 1, untQ[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}], untQ[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}], rowsDef][[1 ;; 2, 1 ;; 2]]], 12]}],\n   Grid[Prepend[Flatten[blockRes, 1], {\"six full rows\", \"eps\", \"det M'\", \"2x2 good block\", \"det M' / (6x6 × 2x2)\"}], Frame -> All]}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"12\" data-out-n=\"92\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"18\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"9\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[92]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:45.6403em;vertical-align:-22.5702em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:23.0701em;\"><span style=\"top:-46.7203em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:24.4902em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">untwisted N’ for {2,1,1,0}: </span></span><span class=\"mord\">6661.87874418</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-23.8701em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:24.4902em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:22.4902em;\"><span style=\"top:-24.4502em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:24.4502em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:44.4003em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-21.9502em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:22.4502em;\"><span style=\"top:-27.4602em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em