   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings (cells 34-35): product form and block dominance do not coexist (non-singlets)\n\n- **82 row choices** give a pure twist product for all three states at once (e.g. `{(1,1),(1,2),(1,3),(1,4),(2,2),(2,4)}`, powers 15, 14, 9).\n- **Their constants are not recognisably simple.** Rational recognition at the Richardson accuracy (~10⁻⁷) returns large-denominator fractions (`25/2268001`, `132/2661121`), which is not evidence of a rational. Only the singlet's `-5/42` looks genuine. (An earlier guess of `1/90720`, `1/20160` was premature and is retracted.)\n- **Block dominance fails for these choices.** For the first common choice, `det M' / (6x6 × 2x2)` is `87.52, 87.41` for `{2,2,0,0}` (ε = 10⁻³, 10⁻⁴) and about `0.005` for `{2,1,1,0}`, not 1. These choices reach product form by cancelling the leading 6x6 terms. That raises the block's power, and then other Laplace terms (full rows on the surviving columns) compete at the same order: the \"sum of minors\" of the paper, p. 5.\n\n**So far:** where the block dominates (lowest-power choices such as set 1), the leading 6x6 coefficient of the non-singlets is not a product. Where it is a product, the block does not dominate. Only the singlet has both. Paul's `Q_12(θ)` hint has not yet been tested against the **dominant** (set-1) coefficient, which is where it would matter.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. A common twist function in the dominant coefficient?\n\nFor the dominant row set (set 1), `C_6` is not a monomial for the non-singlets. But the non-monomial part might be the **same for every state**: `C_6(μ) = R(a)\\, m_μ(a)\\, K_μ`, with `R` common and `m_μ` a monomial in `(a_i - a_j)`. Then the ratio `C_6(μ)/C_6(μ')` on each ray is a monomial times a constant. The constants `K_μ/K_{μ'}` are where untwisted Q-values such as `Q_12(θ)` would show up. The data is the ten rays of cell 25 (`C6data`).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Exact route for `(1,1)` `{2,1,1,0}`\n\n`TASK_N_untw_closed_form.md` §8.2 gives an exact twisted solution for `μ = {L, L-1, 1, 0}`:\n\n`q_1 = 1`, `q_2 = u - r + h z_1/(z_1-z_2)`, `q^4 = 1`, `q^3 = u - r + h z_4/(z_3-z_4)`,\n\nwhere `z_2 (r-θ_1-Sh)(r-θ_2-Ph) = z_3 (r-θ_1)(r-θ_2)`. Following §8.4, the root is eliminated **first**: take `(z_1, z_2, r)` as free parameters, then `z_3` follows rationally and `z_4 = 1/(z_1 z_2 z_3)` (unimodular). Everything is rational, so exact simplification is safe.\n\nOur 6x6 block also needs `q_3`, `q_4`, `q^1`, `q^2`. With `tc` fixed by branches 1-2, every remaining Baxter equation is **linear** in the unknown coefficients. The duals come from exact Wronskians (`qDual`). Here `θ_1 = 1/3`, `θ_2 = 1/7`, `h = 1`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 21. Exact twisted solution for {2,1,1,0} at (1,1), rational in (z1s, z2s, rs). Memory/time capped.\n   (Fixed: the loop over branches 1-2 now iterates over the pairs {k, q_k}; the previous iterator syntax was wrong.) ---- *)\nClearAll[z1s, z2s, rs, exZ3, exZsub, exQ, exTcS, exRec, exChecks, exDualList, exX];\nexZ3 = Together[(z2s (rs - θ1 - 1) (rs - θ2 - 1)/((rs - θ1) (rs - θ2))) /. prm];\nexZsub = Join[prm, {z[1] -> z1s, z[2] -> z2s, z[3] -> exZ3, z[4] -> Together[1/(z1s z2s exZ3)]}];\nexResult = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[Module[{mu = {2, 1, 1, 0}, x, q1f, q2f, eqs, tcSol, b3, c1, c0, q3f, q4f, s3, s4},\n     q1f = Function[y, 1]; q2f = Function[y, y - rs + z1s/(z1s - z2s)];\n     eqs = Join @@ Table[DeleteCases[CoefficientList[Expand[Numerator[Together[Expand[BaxRes[1, 1, mu][kf[[1]]][kf[[2]]][x] /. exZsub]]]], x], 0], {kf, {{1, q1f}, {2, q2f}}}];\n     tcSol = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, tcvars];\n     If[Length[tcSol] =!= 1, Return[{\"tc solve\", Length[tcSol]}]];\n     tcSol = Together /@ First[tcSol];\n     s3 = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ DeleteCases[CoefficientList[Expand[Numerator[Together[Expand[(BaxRes[1, 1, mu][3][Function[y, y + b3]][x] /. exZsub) /. tcSol]]]], x], 0], {b3}];\n     s4 = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ DeleteCases[CoefficientList[Expand[Numerator[Together[Expand[(BaxRes[1, 1, mu][4][Function[y, y^2 + c1 y + c0]][x] /. exZsub) /. tcSol]]]], x], 0], {c0, c1}];\n     If[Length[s3] =!= 1 || Length[s4] =!= 1, Return[{\"q3/q4 solve\", Length[s3], Length[s4]}]];\n     q3f = Function[y, Evaluate[Together[y + b3 /. First[s3]]]]; q4f = Function[y, Evaluate[Together[y^2 + c1 y + c0 /. First[s4]]]];\n     <|\"tc\" -> (tcvars /. tcSol), \"q\" -> {{1}, CoefficientList[Together[q2f[exX]], exX], CoefficientList[q3f[exX], exX], CoefficientList[q4f[exX], exX]}|>],\n    400, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 2*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\nexChecks = If[! AssociationQ[exResult], exResult, Module[{x, mu = {2, 1, 1, 0}, dl},\n    exRec = exResult;\n    dl = Table[Together[qDual[1, 1, exRec, exZsub][l][exX]], {l, 4}];\n    exDualList = dl;\n    {\"residuals == 0\" -> Table[Together[Expand[(BaxRes[1, 1, mu][k][Function[y, qpoly[exRec[\"q\"][[k]], y]]][x] /. exZsub) /. Thread[tcvars -> exRec[\"tc\"]]]] === 0, {k, 4}],\n     \"dual degrees (mu_j = 2,1,1,0)\" -> (Exponent[Numerator[#], exX] - Exponent[Denominator[#], exX] & /@ dl),\n     \"q^3 matches TASK formula\" -> (Together[dl[[3]] - (exX - rs + (z[4]/(z[3] - z[4]) /. exZsub))] === 0),\n     \"q^4 == 1\" -> (Together[dl[[4]]] === 1)}]];\nexChecks",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"29\" data-out-n=\"179\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"38\" data-sub-start=\"25\" data-sub-end=\"25\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[179]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.5em;vertical-align:-6.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7em;\"><span style=\"top:-9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.5em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">residuals == 0</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dual degrees (mu_j = 2,1,1,0)</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3 matches TASK formula</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.34em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">4 == 1</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.84em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.5em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
