  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 21b. The exact tc solve with the TASK formula for q2 has no solution. Compare the formula with a numeric twisted\n   solution in OUR conventions: q2 = u + b2. For each ordered pair (m,n) of twist indices and each root r of\n   z_m (r-th1-1)(r-th2-1) = z_n (r-th1)(r-th2), and each (k,l), test b2 == -r + z_k/(z_k - z_l). ---- *)\nClearAll[diagQ2];\ndiagQ2 = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[Module[{st = twStateN[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, 1/100, 60], zN, b2, b3, rr, x, hits = {}},\n     zN = N[Table[z[l] /. st[\"sub\"], {l, 4}], 60]; b2 = st[\"q\"][[2, 1]]; b3 = st[\"q\"][[3, 1]];\n     Do[If[m != n, rr = x /. NSolve[zN[[m]] (x - 1/3 - 1) (x - 1/7 - 1) == zN[[n]] (x - 1/3) (x - 1/7), x, WorkingPrecision -> 60];\n        Do[Do[If[k != l, Do[If[Abs[-r + zN[[k]]/(zN[[k]] - zN[[l]]) - bb[[2]]] < 10^-20, AppendTo[hits, {bb[[1]], {m, n}, {k, l}, N[r, 8]}]], {bb, {{\"b2\", b2}, {\"b3\", b3}}}]], {k, 4}, {l, 4}], {r, rr}]], {m, 4}, {n, 4}];\n     <|\"b2\" -> N[b2, 10], \"b3\" -> N[b3, 10], \"matches {which, root relation (m,n), (k,l), r}\" -> hits|>], 200, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 2*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\ndiagQ2",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"28\" data-out-n=\"173\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"39\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"9\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[173]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.7em;vertical-align:-4.1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.6em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.1em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.6em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b2</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150.7609000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">66.59624281</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">matches {which, root relation (m,n), (k,l), r}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.73909995</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.73709052</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.1em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[173]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{b2}\\to 150.7609000 \\\\\n  &,\\text{b3} \\\\\n  &\\to 66.59624281 \\\\\n  &,\\text{matches \\{which, root relation (m,n), (k,l), r\\}} \\\\\n  &\\to \\begin{pmatrix}\\text{b2} & \\left\\{2,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & 0.73909995\\\\\\text{b3} & \\left\\{3,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,3\\right\\} & 0.73709052\\end{pmatrix}\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d7220087-0f64-4f8d-8e57-f602a12f5315"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Exact solution verified (cell 39).** All four Baxter residuals vanish identically, the dual degrees are `(2,1,1,0)`, and `q^4 = 1`. `q^3` differs from the TASK formula by a centring convention (checked below). Our duals are the exact Hodge duals used throughout.\n\n**Exact 6x6 block.** On the ray `z_1 = 1+ε a_1`, `z_2 = 1+ε a_2`, `r = r_0 + ερ` (`r_0 = 31/42`; `z_3`, `z_4` then follow exactly, and the ray is curved), each entry of the set-1 6x6 block is expanded as an exact series in `ε`. For rational `(a_1, a_2, ρ)` the coefficients are exact rationals. The leading power and coefficient of the determinant are then exact. Truncation is checked by repeating at a deeper order, and the result is compared with the numerics run on the **same** curved ray.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 22. Exact set-1 6x6 block on a rational ray (a1, a2, rho). h = 1. zeta_j = 1/z_j (unimodular). ---- *)\nClearAll[exRayC6, exRayNum, eps];\nexRayC6[a1_, a2_, rho_, ord_] := Module[{sub = {z1s -> 1 + eps a1, z2s -> 1 + eps a2, rs -> 31/42 + eps rho}, zs, qF, qdF, prodQ, n1, n4, entry, M, D, s},\n   zs = Together[{z1s, z2s, exZ3, 1/(z1s z2s exZ3)} /. sub];\n   qF[i_][y_] := qpoly[exRec[\"q\"][[i]] /. sub, y];\n   qdF[j_][y_] := (exDualList[[j]] /. exX -> y) /. sub;\n   prodQ[i_, j_, k_, y0_] := (-1)^j zs[[i]]^(y0 - k) zs[[j]]^(1 - y0) qdF[j][y0 - 1] qF[i][y0 - k];\n   n1[y_] := ν1[1, 1][y] /. prm; n4[y_] := ν[1, 1][4][y] /. prm;\n   entry[{i_, j_}, c_] := Sum[p[[2]] Switch[c, 3, p[[1]]^2 prodQ[i, j, 1, p[[1]]], 4, p[[1]] prodQ[i, j, 1, p[[1]]], 5, -n4[p[[1]]] prodQ[i, j, 2, p[[1]]],\n        6, -p[[1]] n1[p[[1]] - 1] prodQ[i, j, 0, p[[1]]], 7, p[[1]]^3 prodQ[i, j, 1, p[[1]]], 8, -p[[1]] n4[p[[1]]] prodQ[i, j, 2, p[[1]]]], {s, 2}, {p, ladder[1, 1][s]}];\n   M = Table[Normal[Series[entry[ij, c], {eps, 0, ord}]], {ij, blockSets[[1]]}, {c, 3, 8}];\n   D = Series[Det[M], {eps, 0, ord}];\n   {D[[4]], D[[3, 1]]}];  (* {leading power, leading coefficient} of the SeriesData *)\n(* numeric C6 on the SAME curved ray, via the numeric solver *)\nexRayNum[a1_, a2_, rho_] := Block[{zeps},\n   zeps[e_] := Join[prm, {z[1] -> 1 + e a1, z[2] -> 1 + e a2, z[3] -> (exZ3 /. {z2s -> 1 + e a2, rs -> 31/42 + e rho}), z[4] -> 1/((1 + e a1) (1 + e a2) (exZ3 /. {z2s -> 1 + e a2, rs -> 31/42 + e rho}))}];\n   Module[{es = {1/10000, 1/100000}, m, p, c}, m = Table[m6Of[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, blockSets[[1]], e, 100], {e, es}];\n    p = Round[Log10[Abs[m[[1]]/m[[2]]]]]; c = m/es^p; {p, N[(10 c[[2]] - c[[1]])/9, 12]}]];\nexC6test = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[Module[{t8 = exRayC6[1, 1/3, 1/5, 8], t10 = exRayC6[1, 1/3, 1/5, 10], num = exRayNum[1, 1/3, 1/5]},\n     <|\"q^3 = TASK formula shifted by -1, 0, +1?\" -> Table[Together[(exDualList[[3]] /. exX -> exX + sh) - (exX - rs + (z[4]/(z[3] - z[4]) /. exZsub))] === 0, {sh, {-1, 0, 1}}],\n       \"exact (power, coefficient), order 8\" -> t8, \"exact (power, coefficient), order 10\" -> t10, \"truncation-stable\" -> (t8 === t10),\n       \"numeric (power, coefficient) on same ray\" -> num, \"exact coefficient, numeric\" -> N[t10[[2]], 12]|>], 800, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 3*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\nexC6test",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"30\" data-out-n=\"184\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"41\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[184]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7VElNRSBMSU1JVCBISVR9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TIME LIMIT HIT</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[184]= \\text{TIME LIMIT HIT}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "66a42c97-2939-4a91-944c-d66b887fdf61"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Cell 42 timed out (800 s cap).** Applying `Series` directly to 36 large entries containing `z^{θ+n}` is too slow. The fast version below:\n\n1. expands `log z_j(ε)` once per twist and builds every `z_j^w = exp(w log z_j)` as a truncated polynomial with exact rational coefficients;\n2. expands each Q coefficient once, then assembles the entries by truncated polynomial products, with a buffer of extra orders because the divergent `q`'s carry negative powers of `ε`;\n3. multiplies each row by the power of `ε` that makes it a polynomial before taking the determinant, so that truncation provably cannot affect the determinant below the working order.\n\nTruncation test: two working orders must give the same leading coefficient.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 22b. Fast exact leading coefficient of the set-1 6x6 block on a rational curved ray (a1, a2, rho). h = 1. ---- *)\nClearAll[exRayC6fast];\nexRayC6fast[a1_, a2_, rho_, ordW_] := Module[{ordI = ordW + 10, sub = {z1s -> 1 + eps a1, z2s -> 1 + eps a2, rs -> 31/42 + eps rho}, tr, zsE, lz, zp, qS, qdS, qv, qdv, prodQ, n1, n4, entry, E, mins, Msc, Dsc, low},\n   tr[e_, n_] := Normal[Series[e, {eps, 0, n}]];\n   zsE = Together[{z1s, z2s, exZ3, 1/(z1s z2s exZ3)} /. sub];\n   lz = Table[tr[Log[zsE[[j]]], ordI], {j, 4}];\n   zp = <||>;\n   (* memoised powers z_j^w as truncated polynomials *)\n   zpow[j_, w_] := Lookup[zp, Key[{j, w}], zp[{j, w}] = tr[Exp[w lz[[j]]], ordI]];\n   qS = Table[tr[#, ordI] & /@ (exRec[\"q\"][[i]] /. sub), {i, 4}];\n   qdS = Table[tr[#, ordI] & /@ (CoefficientList[Numerator[exDualList[[j]]], exX]/Denominator[exDualList[[j]]] /. sub), {j, 4}];\n   qv[i_, y_] := qS[[i]] . (y^Range[0, Length[qS[[i]]] - 1]);\n   qdv[j_, y_] := qdS[[j]] . (y^Range[0, Length[qdS[[j]]] - 1]);\n   prodQ[i_, j_, k_, y0_] := tr[Expand[(-1)^j zpow[i, y0 - k] zpow[j, 1 - y0] tr[Expand[qdv[j, y0 - 1] qv[i, y0 - k]], ordI]], ordI];\n   n1[y_] := ν1[1, 1][y] /. prm; n4[y_] := ν[1, 1][4][y] /. prm;\n   entry[{i_, j_}, c_] := tr[Sum[p[[2]] Switch[c, 3, p[[1]]^2 prodQ[i, j, 1, p[[1]]], 4, p[[1]] prodQ[i, j, 1, p[[1]]], 5, -n4[p[[1]]] prodQ[i, j, 2, p[[1]]],\n        6, -p[[1]] n1[p[[1]] - 1] prodQ[i, j, 0, p[[1]]], 7, p[[1]]^3 prodQ[i, j, 1, p[[1]]], 8, -p[[1]] n4[p[[1]]] prodQ[i, j, 2, p[[1]]]], {s, 2}, {p, ladder[1, 1][s]}], ordW];\n   E = Table[entry[ij, c], {ij, blockSets[[1]]}, {c, 3, 8}];\n   (* row scaling to polynomials *)\n   low[e_] := If[e === 0, Infinity, Exponent[e /. eps -> 1/eps, eps] // Minus];\n   mins = Table[Min[low /@ E[[r]]], {r, 6}];\n   Msc = Table[Expand[eps^(-mins[[r]]) E[[r]]], {r, 6}];\n   Dsc = Expand[Det[Msc]];\n   With[{lp = low[Dsc]}, {lp + Total[mins], Coefficient[Dsc, eps, lp], mins}]];\nexFast = <|\n   \"q^3 = TASK formula with u -> u + s, s = -1, 0, 1\" -> Table[Together[(exDualList[[3]] /. exX -> exX + sh) - (exX - rs + (z[4]/(z[3] - z[4]) /. exZsub))] === 0, {sh, {-1, 0, 1}}],\n   \"numeric (power, C6) on the curved ray\" -> MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[exRayNum[1, 1/3, 1/5], 300, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 2*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"],\n   \"exact, working order 16\" -> MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[exRayC6fast[1, 1/3, 1/5, 16], 500, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 3*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"],\n   \"exact, working order 20\" -> MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[exRayC6fast[1, 1/3, 1/5, 20], 600, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 3*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"]|>;\nexFast",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"31\" data-out-n=\"188\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"43\" data-sub-start=\"29\" data-sub-end=\"29\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[188]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:59.0802em;vertical-align:-29.2901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:29.7901em;\"><span style=\"top:-42.1402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-40.6402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-39.1402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-37.6402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-36.1402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-34.6402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-22.7901em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.1001em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\