\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\">⋮</span><span class=\"mord rule\" style=\"color:gray;border-right-width:0em;border-top-width:1.5em;bottom:0em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:black;\">27</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.6499em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.6499em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:12.8em;\"></span><span style=\"color:gray;width:0.667em;height:10.800em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"10.800em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 10800\"><path d=\"M347 1759 V0 H0 V84 H263 V1759 v7200 v1759 H0 v84 H347z\nM347 1759 V0 H263 V1759 v7200 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.1501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.53em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:13.94em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:15.44em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:29.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[188]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{q\\^{}3 = TASK formula with u -> u + s, s = -1, 0, 1} \\\\\n  &\\to \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{False},\\mathrm{False}\\right\\} \\\\\n  &,\\text{numeric (power, C6) on the curved ray} \\\\\n  &\\to \\left\\{2,140.289726109\\right\\} \\\\\n  &,\\text{exact, working order 16} \\\\\n  &\\to \\\\\n  &\\left\\{2,\\frac{\\textcolor{gray}{\\left[\\textcolor{black}{\\begin{gathered}\n  19274778574426030661{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{gray}\\vdots}3181217974{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{gray}\\vdots}5590194504{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{gray}\\vdots}4241926320{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{gray}\\vdots}27\n\\end{gathered}}\\right]}}{\\textcolor{gray}{\\left[\\textcolor{black}{\\begin{gathered}\n  13739265711886849104{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{gray}\\vdots}0895289321{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{gray}\\vdots}7539700584{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{gray}\\vdots}4021248000\n\\end{gathered}}\\right]}},\\left\\{-1,-1,-2,0,-1,-1\\right\\}\\right\\} \\\\\n  &,\\text{exact, working order 20} \\\\\n  &\\to \\\\\n  &\\left\\{2,\\frac{\\textcolor{gray}{\\left[\\textcolor{black}{\\begin{gathered}\n  19274778574426030661{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{gray}\\vdots}3181217974{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  {\\color{… [latex truncated: 1753 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7498ab74-d324-4f8e-b575-db0b44773fd3"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Exact route validated (cell 44).** On the ray `(a_1, a_2, ρ) = (1, 1/3, 1/5)`, the exact leading coefficient of the set-1 6x6 block is a rational number, `C_6 = 140.28972856788119555703…`, power 2. It is identical at working orders 16 and 20 and matches the numerics to 1.75×10⁻⁸. Row lowest powers are `(-1,-1,-2,0,-1,-1)`, as the power table predicts. Our `q^3` equals the TASK formula with `u → u-1` (centring convention).\n\n**Structure.** On this ray scaling `(a_1, a_2, ρ)` by `λ` is scaling `ε` by `λ`, so `C_6` is exactly homogeneous of degree 2. The first-order twist direction is `a_3 = a_2 - Lρ/((r_0-θ_1)(r_0-θ_2))`. Here `(r_0-θ_1)(r_0-θ_2) = \\bar Q_{12}(θ_1+1)\\,\\bar Q_{12}(θ_2+1) = (25/42)(17/42)` with `\\bar Q_{12}(u) = u - r_0`, `r_0 = 31/42`. The probes below keep one first-order direction symbolic (`ρ` chosen so that `a_3` is as stated) and factor the exact result.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 22c. Exact C6 with one symbolic first-order twist direction; rho = 425 (a2 - a3)/3528 so the ray has direction (a1, a2, a3). ---- *)\nClearAll[xs, ys, probeA, probeB, rhoOf];\nrhoOf[a2_, a3_] := 425 (a2 - a3)/3528;\nprobeA = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[With[{r = exRayC6fast[1, xs, rhoOf[xs, -1/2], 16]}, {r[[1]], Factor[Together[r[[2]]]]}], 800, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 4*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\nprobeB = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[With[{r = exRayC6fast[1, 1/3, rhoOf[1/3, ys], 16]}, {r[[1]], Factor[Together[r[[2]]]]}], 800, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 4*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\n(* consistency with the validated number: probe A at a2 = 1/3 must reproduce the ray (1, 1/3, rho) with a3 = -1/2 *)\nGrid[{{\"probe A: a1 = 1, a2 = x, a3 = -1/2\", probeA}, {\"probe B: a1 = 1, a2 = 1/3, a3 = y\", probeB},\n  {\"check: probe A at x = 1/3 vs direct\", If[ListQ[probeA], N[{probeA[[2]] /. xs -> 1/3, exRayC6fast[1, 1/3, rhoOf[1/3, -1/2], 16][[2]]}, 15], \"n/a\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Cell 46 was aborted:** keeping even one twist parameter symbolic made the exact series too slow (probe A exceeded 800 s). **Fallback:** reconstruct `C_6` on the slice `a_1 = 1`, `a_3 = -1/2`, `a_2 = x` from exact values.\n\n1. **Pole orders.** Candidate poles are where two first-order twists coincide: `x = 1` (`a_1=a_2`), `-1/2` (`a_2=a_3`), `-1/4` (`a_2=a_4`), `-3/2` (`a_1=a_4`), `0` (`a_3=a_4`). Orders are measured numerically from the growth of `C_6` at distances `10^{-2}, 10^{-3}`.\n2. **Exact values** at rational points away from the poles, each stored as it completes.\n3. **Reconstruction.** `N(x) = C_6(x) \\prod (x-p)^{k_p}` is rebuilt by exact interpolation and verified on the points not used. Then it is factorised, looking for `\\bar Q_{12}(θ+1)`-type numbers (`25/42`, `17/42`).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 22d. Fallback on the slice a1 = 1, a3 = -1/2, a2 = x. ---- *)\nClearAll[sliceNum, poleOrd, exPts, reconC6, xPts];\nsliceNum[x_] := exRayNum[1, x, rhoOf[x, -1/2]];  (* {power, numeric C6} on the curved ray *)\n(* 1. pole orders: C6 grows like delta^-k near a pole *)\npoleOrd = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[Table[With[{v1 = sliceNum[pc + 1/100], v2 = sliceNum[pc + 1/1000]}, {pc, v1[[1]], v2[[1]], Round[Log10[Abs[v2[[2]]/v1[[2]]]]]}], {pc, {1, -1/2, -1/4, -3/2, 0}}], 900, \"TIME LIMIT HIT\"], 3*10^9, \"MEMORY LIMIT HIT\"];\n(* 2. exact values, one point at a time *)\nxPts = {1/3, 2/3, 3/2, 2, 5/2, -1/3, -2/3, 3, 1/5, -2, 4, 2/7, -3, 5/3, 7/2, -5/2};\nexPts = {};\nTimeConstrained[Do[With[{v = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[exRayC6fast[1, x, rhoOf[x, -1/2], 16], 300, $Failed], 3*10^9, $Failed]}, If[ListQ[v], AppendTo[exPts, {x, v[[1]], v[[2]]}]]], {x, xPts}], 2400];\n(* 3. reconstruct N(x) = C6 * prod (x - p)^k and verify on unused points *)\nreconC6 = If[! ListQ[poleOrd] || Length[exPts] < 6, {\"insufficient data\", poleOrd, Length[exPts]},\n   Module[{D = Product[(xs - pk[[1]])^Max[pk[[4]], 0], {pk, poleOrd}], vals, found = False, NN, m, res},\n    vals = {#[[1]], #[[3]] (D /. xs -> #[[1]])} & /@ exPts;\n    Do[If[! found, NN = Expand[InterpolatingPolynomial[Take[vals, m], xs]];\n       If[AllTrue[Drop[vals, m], (NN /. xs -> #[[1]]) == #[[2]] &], found = True; res = {m, Factor[NN], Factor[NN/D]}]], {m, 3, Length[vals] - 2}];\n    If[found, <|\"points used\" -> res[[1]], \"denominator D\" -> Factor[D], \"numerator N (factored)\" -> res[[2]], \"C6(x) = N/D\" -> res[[3]]|>, {\"no reconstruction with these pole orders\", Length[vals]}]]];\nColumn[{Row[{\"pole orders {p, power at p+1e-2, power at p+1e-3, k}: \", poleOrd}], Row[{\"exact points obtained: \", Length[exPts]}], reconC6}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"34\" data-out-n=\"201\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"47\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[201]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.4153em;vertical-align:-3.9577em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.4577em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.4577em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2577em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pole orders {p, power at p+1e-2, power at p+1e-3, k}: </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:6.000em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"6.000em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 6000\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,2484c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-2492c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,155.3,-396.3,270,-559c6.7,-9.3,10,-15.3,10,-18z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2577em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.4177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mo