"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7577em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2577em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.4177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7577em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2577em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.4177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7577em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2577em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.4177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7577em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:6.000em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"6.000em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 6000\"><path d=\"M76,0c-16.7,0,-25,3,-25,9c0,2,2,6.3,6,13c21.3,28.7,42.3,60.3,\n63,95c96.7,156.7,172.8,332.5,228.5,527.5c55.7,195,92.8,416.5,111.5,664.5\nc11.3,139.3,17,290.7,17,454c0,28,1.7,43,3.3,45l0,2409\nc-3,4,-3.3,16.7,-3.3,38c0,162,-5.7,313.7,-17,455c-18.7,248,-55.8,469.3,-111.5,664\nc-55.7,194.7,-131.8,370.3,-228.5,527c-20.7,34.7,-41.7,66.3,-63,95c-2,3.3,-4,7,-6,11\nc0,7.3,5.7,11,17,11c0,0,11,0,11,0c9.3,0,14.3,-0.3,15,-1c5.3,-5.3,10.3,-11,15,-17\nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-2544c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2577em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exact points obtained: </span></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2577em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">no reconstruction with these pole orders</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9577em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[201]= \\begin{matrix}\\text{pole orders \\{p, power at p+1e-2, power at p+1e-3, k\\}: }\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 2 & 2 & -1\\\\-\\frac{1}{2} & 2 & 2 & -2\\\\-\\frac{1}{4} & 2 & 2 & 2\\\\-\\frac{3}{2} & 2 & 4 & 20\\\\0 & 2 & 2 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\text{exact points obtained: }16\\\\\\left\\{\\text{no reconstruction with these pole orders},16\\right\\}\\end{matrix}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "b49081ba-8bf5-4cb1-ac3d-8bea06dbf3da"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Pole orders (cell 48).** On the slice, `C_6` has zeros at `x = 1` (order 1, `a_1 = a_2`), `x = -1/2` (order 2, `a_2 = a_3`) and `x = 0` (order 1, `a_3 = a_4`), and a pole of order 2 at `x = -1/4` (`a_2 = a_4`). At `x = -3/2` (`a_1 = a_4`) the `ε`-power itself changes (2 → 4), so the measurement is not reliable there. The pole guess was therefore wrong and the reconstruction failed. Below, `C_6 = N/D` is reconstructed **directly** from the 16 exact values: for each degree pair `(n, d)`, solve the exact linear system `N(x_k) = C_k D(x_k)` on `n+d+1` points, verify on the remaining points (at least two), keep the smallest verified degrees, and factor.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 22e. Exact rational reconstruction of C6(x) on the slice from the 16 exact values. ---- *)\nClearAll[ratRecon, reconRes];\nratRecon[pts_] := Module[{npts = Length[pts], best = None},\n   Do[If[best === None && n + d + 1 <= npts - 2,\n      Module[{use = Take[pts, n + d + 1], rest = Drop[pts, n + d + 1], A, ns, cN, cD, Nx, Dx},\n       (* unknowns: N coefficients (n+1), D coefficients (d+1); homogeneous system, one-dimensional kernel wanted *)\n       A = Table[Join[Table[p[[1]]^i, {i, 0, n}], Table[-p[[2]] p[[1]]^j, {j, 0, d}]], {p, use}];\n       ns = NullSpace[A];\n       If[Length[ns] == 1,\n        cN = ns[[1, 1 ;; n + 1]]; cD = ns[[1, n + 2 ;;]];\n        Nx = cN . xs^Range[0, n]; Dx = cD . xs^Range[0, d];\n        If[Dx =!= 0 && AllTrue[rest, Together[(Nx /. xs -> #[[1]]) - #[[2]] (Dx /. xs -> #[[1]])] === 0 &],\n         best = {n, d, Factor[Nx], Factor[Dx], Factor[Together[Nx/Dx]]}]]]],\n     {tot, 0, npts - 3}, {n, 0, tot}, {d, {tot - n}}];\n   best];\nreconRes = ratRecon[{#[[1]], #[[3]]} & /@ exPts];\nIf[reconRes === None, \"no rational reconstruction with <= 14 unknowns\",\n  Grid[{{\"degrees (num, den)\", reconRes[[1 ;; 2]]}, {\"numerator N(x)\", reconRes[[3]]}, {\"denominator D(x)\", reconRes[[4]]}, {\"C6(x) = N/D\", reconRes[[5]]},\n    {\"check at x = 1/3 vs validated 140.2897285678...\", N[reconRes[[5]] /. xs -> 1/3, 15]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"35\" data-out-n=\"205\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"49\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[205]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"11\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7bm8gcmF0aW9uYWwgcmVjb25zdHJ1Y3Rpb24gd2l0aCA8PSAxNCB1bmtub3duc30=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">no rational reconstruction with &lt;= 14 unknowns</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[205]= \\text{no rational reconstruction with <= 14 unknowns}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "387534b6-cfae-4706-91c7-8a4cd57d98af"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**No reconstruction with at most 14 unknowns (cell 50).** `C_6(x)` has higher degree than 16 points can resolve; the divergent `q`'s put factors like `1/(z_1-z_2)` in every row. So: about 70 exact values, and a generous fixed denominator. With `N(x) = C_6(x)\\prod_p (x-p)^{10}` over the five coincidence points, `N` is a polynomial if all true pole orders are at most 10. It is rebuilt by exact interpolation with the smallest number of points that also fits three held-out points, then reduced (`Together`) and factored.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 22f. ~70 exact points on the slice, then N = C6 * prod (x-p)^10 by exact polynomial interpolation. ---- *)\nClearAll[xPts2, exPts2, polyRecon];\nxPts2 = Table[(3 k + 1)/17, {k, -35, 35}];\nexPts2 = {};\nTimeConstrained[Do[With[{v = MemoryConstrained[TimeConstrained[exRayC6fast[1, x, rhoOf[x, -1/2], 16], 120, $Failed], 3*10^9, $Failed]}, If[ListQ[v], AppendTo[exPts2, {x, v[[1]], v[[2]]}]]], {x, xPts2}], 1500];\npolyRecon = Module[{specials = {1, -1/2, -1/4, -3/2, 0}, D, vals, m, NN, found = None},\n   D = Product[(xs - p)^10, {p, specials}];\n   vals = {#[[1]], #[[3]] (D /. xs -> #[[1]])} & /@ exPts2;\n   Do[If[found === None, NN = Expand[InterpolatingPolynomial[Take[vals, m], xs]];\n      If[AllTrue[Take[Drop[vals, m], UpTo[3]], (NN /. xs -> #[[1]]) == #[[2]] &] && Length[Drop[vals, m]] >= 3, found = {m, Together[NN/D]}]], {m, 4, Length[vals] - 3}];\n   If[found === None, {\"not reconstructed\", Length[vals]}, <|\"points used\" -> found[[1]], \"C6(x) reduced\" -> found[[2]], \"numerator (factored)\" -> Factor[Numerator[found[[2]]]], \"denominator (factored)\" -> Factor[Denominator[found[[2]]]],\n      \"check x = 1/3\" -> N[found[[2]] /. xs -> 1/3, 15], \"distinct powers\" -> Union[exPts2[[All, 2]]]|>]];\nColumn[{Row[{\"exact points: \", Length[exPts2]}], polyRecon}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
