 class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[164]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{mu} & \\text{mu'} & \\text{fitted exponents} & \\text{max log residual} & \\text{rounded exponents} & \\text{constant K\\_mu/K\\_mu'} & \\text{spread}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2,0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{-1.9357,5.1352,-3.5503,-9.4736,2.2620,4.9755\\right\\} & 3.36 & \\left\\{-2,5,-4,-9,2,5\\right\\} & 2.437845965 & 7.60\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2,0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{-2.2069,3.3336,4.8988,0.081385,1.4668,0.32493\\right\\} & 1.71 & \\left\\{-2,3,5,0,1,0\\right\\} & 0.0009028865545 & 5.90\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{-0.27126,-1.8016,8.4491,9.5550,-0.79517,-4.6506\\right\\} & 3.90 & \\left\\{0,-2,8,10,-1,-5\\right\\} & 0.001984365122 & 79.3\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
