  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. Untwisted Q-values at the inhomogeneities\n\nThe full-contour entries are sums of residues at the poles `θ_α + nh`, so the leading coefficient of the 6x6 block is naturally built from Q-values there. Following Paul's hint that `Q_12(θ)`-type terms appear, this cell tabulates, for each state, the monic untwisted Casoratians `Q̄_12`, `Q̄_123` (direct) and `Q̄^{34}`, `Q̄^{234}` (dual), and the single `q_k`, `q^j`, at every pole `θ_α + nh`, `n = 0..S_α+1` (this includes `θ_1 + Sh` and `θ_2 + Ph`). The constants `K(μ)` of any row choice that gives a pure twist product are then compared against products of these values.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 19. Library of untwisted Q-values at the poles theta_alpha + n h (h = 1). Casoratian convention as in SU4_SoV_PerturbativeOverlap_L2.wb:\n   Q12(u) = q1(u) q2(u-h) - q1(u-h) q2(u), made monic. ---- *)\nClearAll[casor, qLib, polePts];\ncasor[fs_List][y_] := Det[Table[fs[[a]][y - (b - 1)], {a, Length[fs]}, {b, Length[fs]}]];\npolePts[S_, P_] := Join[Table[(θ1 + n h) /. prm, {n, 0, S + 1}], Table[(θ2 + n h) /. prm, {n, 0, P + 1}]];\nqLib[S_, P_, mu_] := Module[{u0 = UntwSolve0[S, P, mu], x, d, dd, mon, lib},\n   d[k_] := Function[y, qpoly[u0[\"q\"][[k]], y]]; dd[j_] := Function[y, qpoly[u0[\"qd\"][j], y]];\n   mon[f_] := With[{e = Expand[f[x]]}, If[FreeQ[e, x], Function[y, Evaluate[e/e]], Function[y, Evaluate[(e/Coefficient[e, x, Exponent[e, x]]) /. x -> y]]]];\n   lib = <|\"q1\" -> d[1], \"q2\" -> d[2], \"q3\" -> d[3], \"q4\" -> d[4], \"q^4\" -> dd[4], \"q^3\" -> dd[3], \"q^2\" -> dd[2], \"q^1\" -> dd[1],\n     \"Q12\" -> mon[casor[{d[1], d[2]}]], \"Q123\" -> mon[casor[{d[1], d[2], d[3]}]], \"Q^34\" -> mon[casor[{dd[4], dd[3]}]], \"Q^234\" -> mon[casor[{dd[4], dd[3], dd[2]}]]|>;\n   Association[KeyValueMap[#1 -> (#2 /@ polePts[S, P]) &, lib]]];\nqLibTab = Table[{mu, qLib[1, 1, mu]}, {mu, {{2, 2, 0, 0}, {2, 1, 1, 0}, {1, 1, 1, 1}}}];\nColumn[Table[Grid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, Sequence @@ #2} &, t[[2]]], Prepend[polePts[1, 1], t[[1]]]], Frame -> All], {t, qLibTab}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"20\" data-out-n=\"141\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"32\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[141]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:47.0886em;vertical-align:-23.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:23.7943em;\"><span style=\"top:-25.8045em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.1232em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.113em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.073em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.073em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:15.646em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-7.573em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.073em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.2279em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</